<title>USA: CountryBaskets says to liquidate fund.</title>
<headline>CountryBaskets says to liquidate fund.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>CountryBaskets Index Fund Inc said its board approved a plan to liquidate the fund, citing &quot;the continuing inability...to attract significant levels of assets.&quot;</p>
<p>The fund said the liquidation plan will be presented to shareholders at a special meeting set for February 7.</p>
<p>The fund said the board approved the plan on the recommendation of Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, the fund's advisor.</p>
